    "abstract": "Parts list for the in-seat power supply installation in the aft cabin, covering the supply mounting trim, the overhead housing and the seat display and head end server hardware in the same bay.",
    "sections": {
      "purpose": "This figure identifies the installation hardware of the in-seat power supply unit in the aft cabin, together with the neighbouring inflight entertainment items in the same sidewall bay.",
      "figure_note": "The supply unit itself is a vendor item identified by its own rating label and is not detailed here, because operators fit different ratings according to the connected socket count. The figure shows the mounting trim and the overhead housing that set the available depth. Sheet 1 shows the left-hand bay; the right-hand bay is symmetric except for the head end server position."
    },
